{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261015/photo/bkn-20261015181048639-1015_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261015181514\"/><p>事發在黃岩島。</p><p>菲律賓軍艦周四（15日）在黃岩島附近海域升空艦載直升機，非法侵入黃岩島的中國領空，中國人民解放軍南部戰區組織海空力量全程跟監查證、依法警告驅離。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T10:20:25.911668+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T10:10:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T11:17:44.980762+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T10:17:39.868570+00:00","content_hash":"0a2dc18565d3659276b56f1335d538107fd139c895011d600d0900fe31200bc1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}